silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_12_worked_counterexamples_avogadro_sections_02_avogadro_walkthrough_concrete_anchor_2_Cat#cat silm:hasLongDescription "The Cat is the Joy-of-Cats anchor classification object; c:Mittens->Cat. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Cat', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
